- **G3-44-01 D controlled Active amendment/rebaseline**：真实readiness/amendment→exact preparation→assigned approver→activation使新snapshot+完整plan原子生效；pending时旧Active事实/旧handover仍有效。多合同变化、同合同连续两次变化及连续rebaseline，affected完整、旧确认不继承、历史范围风险不被当前替换、已有receipt不重放；拒绝foreign/stale/branch/missing affected，并覆盖amendment/rebaseline必要写回滚。

